OL,3,GNEWSAHollywood star's praise for
OL,4,A'gorgeous' Isle of Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FHollywood actor Ryan Reynolds has
OL,7,Fcalled the Isle of Man "one of the
OL,8,Fbest-kept secrets" after visiting this
OL,9,Fweek.
OL,11,FThe star, best known for Deadpool and
OL,12,Fthe documentary series Welcome to
OL,13,FWrexham, posted about his trip on
OL,14,FInstagram, after fans met him in
OL,15,FDouglas on Thursday.
OL,17,FIn his post, Reynolds is seen at
OL,18,Fvarious locations, including at
OL,19,Fwatchmaker Roger Smith's workshop.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
