OL,3,GNEWSAHollywood star's praise for
OL,4,A'gorgeous' Isle of Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FReynolds wrote: "What a gorgeous place
OL,7,Fto live. Nicest people, a dose of
OL,8,Fperfect weather and home to one of the
OL,9,Fworld's greatest watchmakers."
